2026-10-30T00:00:45Z (RFD66606-2351) '- Moved to SQLite on FoundationDB, all merged 2026-10-18: the zone backend contract (its leftover CockroachDB deploy and notes), the taskweft MMOG agent and the residual FSQ recommender (both tested in CI on a real FoundationDB), and the multiplayer fabric hosting service (compose only, never run: no desk runs containers).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2351  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:46Z (RFD66606-2351) '- Also moved, merged 2026-10-18: weftspun-character-taxonomy. Its image no longer starts a CockroachDB node, and CI finds its test database's keys in FoundationDB. The smoke-test scripts in the multiplayer fabric meta repo need a merge with no CI before they run.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2351  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:47Z (RFD66606-2351) '- Archived: the fabric's CockroachDB service, the Dokku CockroachDB service, the vertex interactor, the fabric's container service, the fabric gateway transport and the fabric infra service (the Terraform for the Fly app, whose daily backup found no started machine on 2026-10-18).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2351  1 LINE
 Text:Written

